flowchart TD
  App[WarpinatorApp] --> Main[MainActivity]
  Main --> Svc[MainService foreground dataSync]
  Svc --> Server[Server / JmDNS / gRPC]
  Svc --> Peers[Remote peer model]
  Server --> Grpc[GrpcService callbacks]
  Grpc --> Transfer[Transfer and FileChunk streaming]
  Main --> Settings[SettingsActivity]
  Main --> Transfers[TransfersActivity]
  Share[ShareActivity SEND] --> Svc
  Boot[Autostart receiver] --> Svc
  Tile[Quick Settings tile] --> Svc
  Provider[Non-exported FileProvider] --> Share
